# Local GigaCode instructions

This file is an example only. Copy it to `.gigacode/GIGACODE.local.md` and keep that file untracked.

Suitable local-only information:
- preferred local test commands;
- temporary WIP notes;
- local fixture/Vault paths used only for development;
- local Ollama endpoint names that are not secrets.

Do not put passwords, API keys, bearer tokens or other secrets here.
Do not use local instructions to override project safety/architecture rules.
